    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式1说明">The axis searches forward for encoder Z phase at CREEP speed. When found, it decelerates to a stop and clears the controller command position (DPOS). A mapped hard limit stops the search.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式2名称">Low-speed reverse search for encoder Z phase</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式2说明">This works like mode 1 in the reverse direction: the axis searches for encoder Z phase at CREEP speed, then clears the controller command position (DPOS). A mapped hard limit stops the search.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式3名称">Fast forward home search, then slow reverse re-search</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式3说明">The axis moves forward at SPEED until the home switch is reached, decelerates to a stop, then searches backward at CREEP for the home signal again. It stops and clears the controller command position (DPOS) when found. A mapped hard limit stops the search.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式4名称">Fast reverse home search, then slow forward re-search</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式4说明">This works like mode 3 in the opposite direction: the axis searches backward at SPEED, then searches forward at CREEP for the home signal again and clears the controller command position (DPOS). A mapped hard limit stops the search.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式5名称">Forward to home switch, then slow reverse search for Z</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式5说明">The axis moves forward at SPEED to the home switch, stops, then searches backward at CREEP for encoder Z phase. It stops and clears the controller command position (DPOS) when found. Both the home switch and encoder Z phase are required.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式6名称">Reverse to home switch, then slow forward search for Z</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式6说明">This works like mode 5 in the opposite direction: the axis searches backward for the home switch, then searches forward at CREEP for encoder Z phase and clears the controller command position (DPOS). Both signals are required.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式8名称">Fast forward home-switch search, then stop</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式8说明">The axis searches forward at SPEED for the home switch. When triggered, it decelerates to a stop and clears the controller command position (DPOS); it does not reverse for a slow re-search. A mapped hard limit stops the search.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式9名称">Fast reverse home-switch search, then stop</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式9说明">This works like mode 8 in the reverse direction: the axis searches backward at SPEED for the home switch, then decelerates to a stop and clears the controller command position (DPOS).</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式11名称">Low-speed Z search; reverse if a limit is reached</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式11说明">The basic search is like mode 1. If a mapped positive or negative limit is reached, the mode-number +10 rule reverses the search. When Z phase is found, the controller command position (DPOS) is cleared.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式12名称">Reverse low-speed Z search; reverse at a limit</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式12说明">The basic search is like mode 2. If a mapped positive or negative limit is reached, the mode-number +10 rule reverses the search. When Z phase is found, the controller command position (DPOS) is cleared.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式13名称">Forward home search; reverse at a limit</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式13说明">The basic search is like mode 3. The axis searches forward first; if a mapped limit is reached first, the controller reverses and continues searching for home, then leaves the home signal at CREEP speed and clears the controller command position (DPOS).</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式14名称">Reverse home search; move forward at a limit</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式14说明">The basic search is like mode 4. The axis searches backward first; if a mapped limit is reached first, the controller moves forward and continues searching for home, then leaves the home signal at CREEP speed and clears the controller command position (DPOS).</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式15名称">Home and Z search; reverse at a limit</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式15说明">The basic search is like mode 5 and uses the mode-number +10 limit-reversal rule: when a mapped limit is reached, the controller reverses and continues searching. When Z phase is found, the controller command position (DPOS) is cleared. Both signals are required.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式16名称">Reverse home and Z search; reverse at a limit</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式16说明">The basic search is like mode 6 and uses the mode-number +10 limit-reversal rule: when a mapped limit is reached, the controller reverses and continues searching. When Z phase is found, the controller command position (DPOS) is cleared. Both signals are required.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式18名称">Forward home-switch search; reverse at a limit</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式18说明">The basic search is like mode 8 and uses the mode-number +10 limit-reversal rule: when a mapped limit is reached, the controller reverses and continues searching for home. The controller command position (DPOS) is cleared when the home switch is reached.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式19名称">Reverse home-switch search; reverse at a limit</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="正运动DATUM模式19说明">The basic search is like mode 9 and uses the mode-number +10 limit-reversal rule: when a mapped limit is reached, the controller reverses and continues searching for home. The controller command position (DPOS) is cleared when the home switch is reached.</sys:String>
